title: $:/language/hypergsd/Convert/

# Action-to-project conversion. Fragment tiddlers ($:/tags/hypergsd/Convert/Warning)
# carry a warning field holding the KEY of an entry under Warnings/ below.
Base: Convert this action into a project?
DefaultButtonLabel: convert
Warnings/OwnPrerequisites: This action still has pre-requisites, which will be cleared when it becomes a project.
Warnings/Prerequisite: Other actions depend on this action as a pre-requisite. Pre-requisites only apply between actions, not projects.